        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "intro",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "hero"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "hero-eyebrow"
          },
          "html": "🕰️ · Long-term couples · Guided audio · AI"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h1",
          "attrs": {},
          "html": "You know each other by heart.<br><em>Rediscover each other anyway.</em>"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {},
          "html": "Explore AI audio fiction together with Caresse: your names or aliases, narrated by a synthetic voice. Fixed demos are free; personalized sessions use paid credits, without a subscription."
        },
        {
          "tag": "div",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "cta-group"
          },
          "html": "\n            <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/caresse/id6758887086?l=en-US\" id=\"hero-cta\" class=\"cta-pink\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                \n                <span class=\"inline\">Download for free</span>\n            </a>\n        "
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "hero-badge"
          },
          "html": "Available on iOS & Android · Free demos · Paid personalized sessions"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "truth"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "What many couples experience"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Routine isn't a flaw.<br>It's just a starting point."
        },
        {
          "type": "cards",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "truth-grid"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "truth-item"
              },
              "html": "\n                \n                <p class=\"label\">The problem</p>\n                \n                <p>You know what works, so you come back to it. But that comfort ends up smothering curiosity and the desire for surprise.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "truth-item"
              },
              "html": "\n                \n                <p class=\"label\">The Caresse solution</p>\n                \n                <p>Choose your preferences together, then let the AI create a narrative in the app. You do not have to write the script; conversation and mutual agreement remain essential.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "truth-item"
              },
              "html": "\n                \n                <p class=\"label\">What changes</p>\n                \n                <p>You stop being the scriptwriters of your intimacy. You become participants, free to feel without having to manage everything.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "truth-item"
              },
              "html": "\n                \n                <p class=\"label\">What it doesn't replace</p>\n                \n                <p>Caresse does not replace your connection, communication or professional support when needed. It offers audio fiction to explore together at your own pace.</p>\n            "
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "benefits"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "What Caresse brings"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Novelty without the work of finding it."
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-sub"
          },
          "html": "In a long relationship, energy is often as scarce as ideas. Caresse handles both. And if time is what you're really short of, see <a href=\"/en/for-busy-couples/\" style=\"color:var(--primary-vibrant);font-weight:600;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px;\">how to make time for intimacy when you're busy</a>."
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "compare-note",
            "style": "margin-top:24px;"
          },
          "html": "For a change from your usual ritual, a <a href=\"/en/couples-game/\">couples game without cards</a> lets a voice guide a scenario created from your choices. You remain free to follow or skip each suggestion."
        },
        {
          "type": "cards",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "benefits-grid"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "benefit-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"icon\">🎲</div>\n                \n                <h3>The AI sets the scene</h3>\n                \n                <p>No more searching for ideas or waiting for the other to suggest something. You configure your current desires together, and Caresse generates something you didn't expect.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "benefit-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"icon\">🔊</div>\n                \n                <h3>Speaker or bluetooth speaker, within reach</h3>\n                \n                <p>Put down the phone, use the speaker or connect to a bluetooth speaker. The voice fills the room and guides both partners, without anyone having to hold the device.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "benefit-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"icon\">🔁</div>\n                \n                <h3>A narrative created with each request</h3>\n                \n                <p>The AI generates fiction in the app from your choices. Results can vary with the same preferences. Creation uses paid credits; similarities or inconsistencies remain possible.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "benefit-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"icon\">💬</div>\n                \n                <h3>Reconnect without the hard words</h3>\n                \n                <p>The setup can open a conversation about what interests you today. The options help you express preferences and boundaries, without replacing explicit agreement.</p>\n            "
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "how"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "How it works"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "A new experience in four steps."
        },
        {
          "type": "cards",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "steps-grid"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "step-item"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"num\">01</div>\n                \n                <h3>Configure together</h3>\n                \n                <p>Browse options together: atmosphere, tone, intensity, dynamics. It's already a conversation about what you really want tonight.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "step-item"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"num\">02</div>\n                \n                <h3>The AI generates your session</h3>\n                \n                <p>Caresse creates audio fiction from your preferences. Generation can take a few minutes; the content and duration vary by session.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "step-item"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"num\">03</div>\n                \n                <h3>Put down the phone, turn on the speaker</h3>\n                \n                <p>Use the speaker or connect to a bluetooth speaker. The voice guides both partners, hands free.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "step-item"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"num\">04</div>\n                \n                <h3>Let yourself be surprised</h3>\n                \n                <p>Close your eyes. The voice takes over, creates the atmosphere, guides the tempo. You have nothing to decide, just to feel.</p>\n            "
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "faq"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "Frequently asked questions"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "What you want to know"
        },
        {
          "type": "faq",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "faq-list"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Does Caresse really work when you know each other very well?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Knowing your preferences can help you choose a setup together. Caresse then creates audio fiction from those choices. A free demo lets you hear the voice and format before paying for a personalized session."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "How to use Caresse together without headphones?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Place the phone on a nearby surface, use the speaker or connect to a bluetooth speaker. The voice guides both partners naturally, without anyone having to hold the device."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "What if one of us is less enthusiastic than the other?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Talk before starting and only take part if you both want to. A demo can help you explore the format together, but no one needs to be persuaded to join in. Either person can decline, pause or stop at any time."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Does the content get repetitive over time?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Each personalized session is generated on demand by AI from your choices. Identical settings can produce different results, but similarities, repetitions or inconsistencies remain possible. The free demos are fixed recordings."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Can Caresse help get through a dry spell in the relationship?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Caresse offers guided fiction to share if you both want to. The app does not guarantee an improvement in your relationship and does not replace communication or professional support when needed."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "How often should long-term couples use Caresse?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "There is no recommended frequency. Choose a time and pace that suit you both, whether for a special occasion or time together. Using the app remains a shared choice, never an obligation."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Is Caresse free for long-term couples?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "The download and fixed demos are free. Creating personalized audio fiction in the app uses a paid credit, without a subscription. Prices are shown before purchase; the optional preference unlock does not include unlimited generation."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
